          answer: 'Australian privacy requirements implemented by ClickMasters: Privacy Act 1988 and Australian Privacy Principles (APPs 1-13  collection notice, purpose limitation, security measures, access and correction rights  standard for all Australian applications), Spam Act 2003 (express or inferred consent for commercial electronic messages, unsubscribe mechanism, 3-business-day processing  standard for all Australian applications sending commercial emails or push notifications), Disability Discrimination Act 1992 accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA  the Australian Human Rights Commission\'s recommended standard for Australian web accessibility), and sector-specific compliance on request: APRA CPS 234 for financial services, My Health Records Act for healthcare, Consumer Data Right for open banking fintech. ClickMasters includes an Australian privacy compliance review in the discovery phase of every Australian engagement.',
