          answer: 'ClickMasters covers Gulf Standard Time (GST, UTC+4) for UAE clients. The UAE does not observe daylight saving time, making GST a consistent offset year-round  no seasonal schedule adjustments required. All sprint ceremonies (standups, sprint planning, reviews, retrospectives) are scheduled between 9am and 6pm GST. Slack response within 2 hours during UAE business hours (Sunday-Thursday). P0 incident response within 1 hour during UAE business hours. ClickMasters accounts for the UAE working week (Sunday-Thursday, with Friday-Saturday weekend) in sprint planning  the sprint cycle aligns with the UAE calendar, not a Monday-Friday calendar. The timezone alignment between Pakistan (PKT, UTC+5) and UAE (GST, UTC+4) is the best of any ClickMasters client geography  only 1 hour difference, creating natural full-day overlap.',
